      "Most often the real answer is some version of: it was doing a job that the rest of your life isn't currently equipped to do. The substance was a workaround. Not for a moral failing, not for a chemical predisposition — for a structural absence. There is something you need in your life that you do not currently have, and the substance was the part-time temp, working off the books, paid in damage.",
