      "Stop smoking, and the world doesn't notice. Stop cannabis, and the world doesn't notice. Stop opioids, and the world, if anything, breathes a relief. Stop alcohol, and every social event you attend for the next year will contain a small interrogation. Are you sure? Just one. Come on. Is everything okay? Are you on antibiotics? Is something wrong?",
